## First attested

For each god, the earliest witness of any kind and the earliest text, each
written by `line`, the trait's default body. A god with no tablet is first
named in Homer or Hesiod; Aphrodite's oldest witness is her sanctuary at
Paphos.

```hql#eval
ev.first
```
<!-- hql:output hash=258f68949950 status=ok -->
